  "title": "Novartis provides support for Moroccan earthquake victims",
  "summary": "Novartis is deeply concerned and saddened by the devastation caused by the earthquake in Morocco on September 9, 2023. Our thoughts are with the people affected by this tragic disaster. We can confirm that our Novartis associates are safe.",
